{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074510/extras/ef2215e8f9606f25408efabd952e548c.avif?t=1774603831\" width=1560 height=284 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fleet Hunters</strong> is a fast, modern reimagining of \u00a0the classic naval battle where every decision, every volley, and every moment counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your strategy, position your ships, and predict your opponent\u2019s moves. Then, when both commanders lock in their choices, the action unfolds <strong>simultaneously</strong>: A single burst of missiles, explosions, and shifting tides that can turn victory into defeat in an instant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074510/extras/0a55d1a99d19e4eccbd0fced8b9e40f1.poster.avif?t=1774603831\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=800 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074510/extras/0a55d1a99d19e4eccbd0fced8b9e40f1.webm?t=1774603831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074510/extras/0a55d1a99d19e4eccbd0fced8b9e40f1.mp4?t=1774603831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simultaneous Turns, Maximum Tension</strong>:\u00a0Both players act at once, creating fast, unpredictable battles where anticipation is everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Grid-Based Combat</strong>:\u00a0Easy to learn, endlessly replayable, and built around clever positioning and bold guesses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Depth</strong>: \u00a0Every ship placement and shot matters; a single misstep can cost you the match.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Modes</strong>: \u00a0Challenge friends locally over LAN or face off against players worldwide through online matchmaking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clean, Modern Design</strong>:\u00a0A refined interface that keeps the focus on pure strategy and satisfying gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fleet Hunters</i> captures the timeless thrill of the original naval battle ships duel refined for a new generation of tacticians. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan. Predict. Fire. Watch the sea erupt.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4074510?t=1774603831","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074510/99091c4f630530e8be120488dcaabfe92c9c335b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774603831","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074510/84883f0b3fa642271bbd37cd7dff7672474a2488/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774603831","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074510/84883f0b3fa642271bbd37cd7dff7672474a2488/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774603831","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Touch Only Option",